{"source":"github","project_id":"shinysense","target":"nstrayer/shinysense","id":"pr/41","ref":41,"title":"Fix missing imports in shinyviewr server function","description":"The `shinyviewr` server function calls `%\u003e%` from magrittr, and `str_remove` and `str_replace` from stringr without importing them. No stringr functions are used elsewhere so I suggest using `gsub` instead to avoid adding another dependency.","published_at":"2019-10-10T21:42:06Z","updated_at":"2019-10-11T17:20:21Z","url":"https://github.com/nstrayer/shinysense/pull/41","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"SimonLarsen","merged_at":"2019-10-11T17:20:21Z","state":"MERGED"}}
